  "tempo": 1.12,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Your car may have been answering this question your entire life.",
      "start": 0.07,
      "end": 2.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Look at the little fuel pump symbol on your dashboard.",
      "start": 3.13,
      "end": 5.382
    },
    {
      "text": "On many cars, there's a tiny arrow or triangle beside it.",
      "start": 5.692,
      "end": 8.747
    },
    {
      "text": "If it points left, your fuel door is on the left.",
      "start": 9.043,
      "end": 11.505
    },
    {
      "text": "If it points right, it's on the right.",
      "start": 11.804,
      "end": 13.483
    },
    {
      "text": "Manufacturers don't all put fuel doors on the same side, so this tiny symbol saves",
      "start": 13.845,
      "end": 18.258
    },
    {
      "text": "you from guessing,",
      "start": 18.259,
      "end": 18.937
    },
    {
      "text": "which means every time you pulled into a gas station,",
      "start": 19.252,
      "end": 21.467
    },
    {
      "text": "chose the wrong pump,",
      "start": 21.793,
      "end": 22.703
    },
    {
      "text": "reversed, and tried again,",
      "start": 22.992,
      "end": 24.421
    },
    {
      "text": "the answer may have been glowing directly in front of your face.",
      "start": 24.725,
      "end": 27.26
    }
  ],
